    <Markdown id="bmod_h3_graph_submit">
### Submitting it

Your graph above is your figure for this item. Print this page to PDF and
include it with your handout in Canvas, or screenshot the chart.
    </Markdown>

    <!-- ignoreSubmitLock: printing {{corpus:Q4b/p13:modify:42:63:sha=ae62a6d034c3}} must still work after
         the handout is handed in. Submitting freezes the inputs and the
         feedback buttons; a student who then wants another copy of their graph
         page is not editing anything. -->
